        <mxCell id="steps" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Hybrid Networking Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;① On-premises connects via Direct Connect&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;② Site-to-Site VPN provides backup path&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;③ Transit Gateway acts as central hub&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;④ TGW routes traffic between all VPCs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑤ Network Firewall inspects east-west traffic&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑥ Route 53 Resolver for hybrid DNS&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑦ RAM shares TGW across accounts" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#E0E0E0;fontSize=12;spacing=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
